  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Text: The HUD is designed for a target aspect ratio of 4:3. At this aspect ratio,
    all HUD components should fit on the screen with no scaling. Any special HUD
    components in the bottom middle must not be wider than 300px (50% of the width
    at 4:3). At aspect ratios narrower than 4:3, all HUD components shrink automatically.
